# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — DAYCRAFT
## A Private, Offline-First Personal Life Management System for Android and Windows

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, native application engineer, offline AI engineer, product designer, accessibility specialist, and QA engineer.

Your mission is to design, implement, test, and prepare for release a complete personal productivity application with the working title **Daycraft**. The product name must be configurable and easy to change globally.

This is a real software engineering project, not a UI mockup, landing page, or prototype. Implement working features, persistent storage, actual application logic, error handling, platform integrations, and automated tests.

Do not stop after producing a plan or a visually impressive dashboard. Build the application in verifiable stages, preserve working code, validate integrations, and continue until the required deliverables are complete or a specific environment limitation prevents completion.

